{
  "id": "bus_slice",
  "title": "Bus window framing calibration after FBX basis correction",
  "source": "D-40 #1「车先出一个切片」；D-36 #1 近景按 VR 像素密度；D-40 #4 几何高光抗锯齿; local camera calibration only",
  "requires": {
    "folders": [
      "Assets/Lanbai/Common",
      "Assets/Lanbai/Bus",
      "Assets/Lanbai/Bus/Editor"
    ],
    "menus": [
      "蓝白/Build/车 切片"
    ],
    "types": [
      "LanbaiBusSliceBuilder"
    ],
    "why": "车的切片还没交。约定（总导演 D-40 回复 #10）：仓库里没有 .meta，所以不交 .unity 场景，交一个搭建菜单 蓝白/Build/车 切片（类名 LanbaiBusSliceBuilder：工具靠这个类在不在来判断切片交没交，菜单在不在 Unity 没有可靠的读法），在本地现搭：它在当前场景（工具给它一个沙盒里的空场景）里建 Slice_Seat、Slice_SideWindow、Slice_Pillar 三件和一台带 PostProcessLayer 的相机；要写的生成物放 Assets/Lanbai/Bus/Generated/。光照图：本地烘就把烘焙设置写进车的 README；用预烘好的 _CabinTubeLM 贴图就照 D-32 从 uv1 读（那样场景里没有 Unity 的光照图，has_lightmaps 只警告）"
  },
  "scene": {
    "mode": "new",
    "why": "沙盒里的空场景，搭建菜单往里搭"
  },
  "allowed_writes": [
    "Assets/Lanbai/Bus/Generated/**",
    "Assets/Lanbai/UdonPrograms/**",
    "Assets/SerializedUdonPrograms/**"
  ],
  "require_ppv2": true,
  "build": [
    {
      "type": "menu",
      "path": "蓝白/Build/车 切片"
    }
  ],
  "settings": {
    "vertex_compression_off": [
      "TexCoord0",
      "TexCoord1",
      "TexCoord2",
      "TexCoord3",
      "Color"
    ],
    "gate": true
  },
  "cameras": {
    "window_05_rear": {
      "look_at_object": "**/Slice_SideWindow",
      "toward": [
        0.55,
        1.7,
        2.05
      ],
      "distance": 0.5,
      "crop_deg": [
        40,
        30
      ],
      "ppd": 20,
      "ss": 2,
      "why": "Actual frame joint after 180-degree basis correction; camera calibration, same distance/crop/ppd",
      "look_at_anchor": [
        0.5,
        0.785,
        0.226
